[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2054470209","pull_request_review_id":2784695579,"id":2054470209,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc56dLpB","diff_hunk":"@@ -16,4 +16,12 @@\n   <Target Name=\"Clean\">\n     <Exec Command=\"$(NMakeCleanCommandLine)\"/>\n   </Target>\n+  <ItemDefinitionGroup>\n+    <ClCompile>\n+      <AdditionalOptions>%(AdditionalOptions)$(AdditionalOptions)</AdditionalOptions>","path":"misc/msvs/nmake.substitution.props","commit_id":"df622f1f0bca30ddd368d69c0b0b5021ddef9c70","original_commit_id":"a9132e1116fb9e7199cccae1646e8c6b74395510","user":{"login":"shana","id":310137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDEzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/310137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana","html_url":"https://github.com/shana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This won't affect consoles so it's fine by me, but why are you doing `%(AdditionalOptions)` before `$(AdditionalOptions)` here? Is there some item defined in an `ItemGroup` that has `AdditionalOptions` metadata? That's the only thing I can imagine would need this.","created_at":"2025-04-22T16:35:47Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T16:35:47Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105650#discussion_r2054470209","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105650","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2054470209"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105650#discussion_r2054470209"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105650"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2054470209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":21,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2054493562","pull_request_review_id":2784733730,"id":2054493562,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc56dRV6","diff_hunk":"@@ -16,4 +16,12 @@\n   <Target Name=\"Clean\">\n     <Exec Command=\"$(NMakeCleanCommandLine)\"/>\n   </Target>\n+  <ItemDefinitionGroup>\n+    <ClCompile>\n+      <AdditionalOptions>%(AdditionalOptions)$(AdditionalOptions)</AdditionalOptions>\n+    </ClCompile>\n+    <Link>\n+      <TargetMachine>Machine$(Platform)</TargetMachine>","path":"misc/msvs/nmake.substitution.props","commit_id":"df622f1f0bca30ddd368d69c0b0b5021ddef9c70","original_commit_id":"a9132e1116fb9e7199cccae1646e8c6b74395510","user":{"login":"shana","id":310137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDEzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/310137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana","html_url":"https://github.com/shana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Again, fine by me regardless, but looking at VS, what it's doing is setting this value in the following manner:\r\n\r\nC:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Visual Studio\\2022\\Community\\MSBuild\\Microsoft\\VC\\v170\\Platforms\\ARM\\Platform.Common.props:\r\n`<TargetMachine Condition=\"'%(Link.TargetMachine)' == ''\">MachineARM</TargetMachine>`\r\n\r\nC:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Visual Studio\\2022\\Community\\MSBuild\\Microsoft\\VC\\v170\\Platforms\\Win32\\Platform.Common.props:\r\n`<TargetMachine Condition=\"'%(Link.TargetMachine)' == ''\">MachineX86</TargetMachine>`\r\n\r\nC:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Visual Studio\\2022\\Community\\MSBuild\\Microsoft\\VC\\v170\\Platforms\\x64\\Platform.Common.props:\r\n`<TargetMachine Condition=\"'%(Link.TargetMachine)' == ''\">MachineX64</TargetMachine>`\r\n\r\nThe `Platform` property is usually defined as `x64`, `Win32` or I think possibly `arm64`(?), and these won't generate the same `TargetMachine` string that VS is expecting. I don't know what Rider is expecting and whether it cares that it's going to get `MachineWin32` instead of `MachineX86` for a win32 build, but that might break something?","created_at":"2025-04-22T16:52:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T16:52:41Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105650#discussion_r2054493562","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105650","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2054493562"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105650#discussion_r2054493562"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105650"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2054493562/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":27,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":9,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"}]